x154 text ".copy[data-copied=\"1\"]::after{display:none}\n.copy[data-copied=\"fail\"]{border-color:var(--loss)}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.copy{transition:border-color .15s,color .15s}}\n.copy-status{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;margin:-1px;padding:0;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;border:0}\n/* Home page (site/gen/page.tpl; its root is div.home). A ruled column: the hero (statement, install line, an agent edit in a terminal over the code rain), the token figure, how an edit is checked, where A0 loses, install. Sections are sized by their content. */\n.home{--hg:var(--a0);--hink:#000;--hrain:.9;--hhead:#d6ffe0;--hcard:#0a0a0a;--hmute:#8a9a8e;--hline:#1f1f1f;--hred:#ff5f56}\n.home .hwrap{max-width:1232px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:var(--hdr);border-left:1px solid var(--hline);border-right:1px solid var(--hline)}\n.home section{border-bottom:1px solid var(--hline)}\n"
